  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Visual style (follow exactly): Editorial magazine cover layout: a large share of the frame reserved for a confident serif display headline as the hero element, thin rules and a keyline frame, one restrained subject integrated with the typography, strict grid and clear hierarchy, sophisticated muted palette with one accent colour, matte print feel.",
